---
title: Dream pass - manual consolidation via subagent
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User
  participant Cmd as /dream command
  participant Skill as memory-dream skill
  participant SA as pi-subagents
  participant Worker as Dream subagent<br/>(isolated context)
  participant Vault as Vault (80_AI/ + 10_Weekly/)
  participant Tools as memory_* tools

  Note over User: Manual invocation only<br/>(notify at session_start if overdue)

  User->>Cmd: /dream or /dream --dry-run
  Cmd->>Skill: invoke memory-dream skill
  Skill->>Vault: find files newer than .last_dream.marker
  Note over Skill,Vault: First run: no marker means read everything in scope

  Skill->>SA: spawn subagent with awake-period scope
  SA->>Worker: launch with prompt + scoped files

  Note over Worker: Worker runs in own context window

  Worker->>Worker: phase 1 - resolve contradictions
  Worker->>Worker: phase 2 - promote repeated themes to domains
  Worker->>Worker: phase 3 - summarize + archive oversized notes
  Worker->>Worker: phase 4 - enrich links + frontmatter
  Worker->>Worker: phase 5 - surface ideas from session JSONLs

  Worker-->>SA: structured edit plan + dreamlog section + ideas
  SA-->>Skill: return summary

  alt --dry-run
    Skill-->>User: preview edit plan (no writes)
  else
    Skill->>Tools: apply edits through managed memory tools
    Tools->>Vault: write changes
    Skill->>Tools: append dreamlog section
    Skill->>Vault: touch .last_dream.marker
    Skill-->>User: dream complete
  end

  Note over Vault: All writes scoped to managed vault roots
